  71:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             __HAL_UART_ENABLE_IT() and __HAL_UART_DISABLE_IT() inside the transmit
  72:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_uart.c ****             and receive process.
